<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"> <head> <meta charset="utf-8"> <meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes" name="viewport"> <title>table_attributes</title> </head> <body> <main> <h1 id="sec:tables">1 Table attribute combinations</h1> <p>Table <a href="#tbl:directional">1</a> selects one row and one column while leaving other cells unchanged.</p> <table data-alignment="left" data-autofit="content" data-cell-margin-bottom="2mm" data-cell-margin-right="4mm" data-cell_margin_left="3mm" data-cell_margin_top="1mm" data-revision-columns="3" data-revision_rows="2" data-row-height="0.6cm" id="tbl:directional"> <caption>Table 1 Directional margins and selective revisions.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>Item</th> <th>Value</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Notes</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Baseline</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">10</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Original</td> </tr> <tr> <td>Candidate</td> <td>12</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Updated</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-custom-style="Para After Table"> <p>The paragraph after the table should retain its post-table style.</p> </div> <table data-revision-rows="*" id="tbl:all-rows"> <caption>Table 2 A newly added table with a revised caption.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Method</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Score</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Added method</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">15</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table data-custom-style="TableNoBorder" data-revision_columns="*" id="tbl:all-columns"> <caption>Table 3 Whole-table revision selected through columns.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Method</th> <th data-custom-style="Revision Char">Score</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">Another method</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">16</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table data-custom-style="TableNoBorder" data-custom-text-style="Body Text" data-revision_rows="2" id="tbl:text-style"> <caption>Table 4 Custom cell paragraphs with an independent table style.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <p>Item</p> </div>
</th> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <p>Description</p> </div>
</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">
<div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <p>Styled cell</p> </div>
</td> <td data-custom-style="Revision Char">
<div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <p>
<strong>Bold</strong> and <em>italic</em> text</p> </div>
</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="2">
<div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <p>Merged cell</p> </div>
</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-custom-style="Para After Table"> <p>This paragraph keeps its post-table style.</p> </div> <table data-custom_text_style="Quote" id="tbl:alias-text-style"> <caption>Table 5 The underscore alias also selects cell paragraph styles.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Item</p> </div>
</th> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Value</p> </div>
</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Alias style</p> </div>
</td> <td>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>18</p> </div>
</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table id="tbl:default-text-style"> <caption>Table 6 The following table retains its default cell style.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>Item</th> <th>Value</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>Default style</td> <td>20</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <table data-custom-text-style="Quote"> <colgroup> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Uncaptioned styled cell</p> </div>
</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>A cell without a visible caption</p> </div>
</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> <div data-custom-style="Body Text"> <table data-custom-text-style="Quote" id="tbl:block-text-style"> <caption>Table 7 A table inside a styled block with multiple cell paragraphs and a list.</caption> <colgroup> <col> <col> </colgroup> <thead> <tr> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Nested content</p> </div>
</th> <th>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Value</p> </div>
</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody> <tr> <td> <div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>First cell paragraph.</p> </div> <div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Second cell paragraph.</p> </div> </td> <td>
<ul> <li>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>First list item</p> </div>
</li> <li>
<div data-custom-style="Quote"> <p>Second list item</p> </div>
</li> </ul>
</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </main> </body> </html>
